{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AFTER TODAY, YOU\u2019RE NEVER GOING TO FORGET THIS EASTER\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAKING NEWS:</strong> <i>A man in a rabbit costume has broken into a local middle school and is attacking students, teachers, and staff with a chainsaw. Authorities have surrounded the building and are attempting to enter without risking further casualties.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the kids trapped inside during the lockdown. The front doors are barricaded, so your only options are escape or death. Stay quiet and move carefully, watch every corner as a direct encounter with the killer could mean certain death\u2026 or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE LONG ENOUGH TO ESCAPE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense, and terrifying experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear and tension are guaranteed from start to finish. There\u2019s never a moment of rest \u2014 it\u2019s a race against time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely defenseless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or die \u2014 those are your only options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll never know what to expect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Killer Rabbit is cunning \u2014 he\u2019ll always find a way to catch you by surprise when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability to keep you coming back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items always spawn in different locations, and events never happen in the same order. It\u2019s the Killer Rabbit who decides your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer to share the scares with your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends can play as the children trying to escape, or become the Killer Rabbit to hunt them down.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119160?t=1763555944","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/bfaf3eb6449d1a1d46d855e34158d9b7a2445a3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763555944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/50943f632026dd79acb396129577eb0ab8cc2e20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763555944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/50943f632026dd79acb396129577eb0ab8cc2e20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763555944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AFTER TODAY, YOU\u2019RE NEVER GOING TO FORGET THIS EASTER\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAKING NEWS:</strong> <i>A man in a rabbit costume has broken into a local middle school and is attacking students, teachers, and staff with a chainsaw. Authorities have surrounded the building and are attempting to enter without risking further casualties.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the kids trapped inside during the lockdown. The front doors are barricaded, so your only options are escape or death. Stay quiet and move carefully, watch every corner as a direct encounter with the killer could mean certain death\u2026 or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE LONG ENOUGH TO ESCAPE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense, and terrifying experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear and tension are guaranteed from start to finish. There\u2019s never a moment of rest \u2014 it\u2019s a race against time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely defenseless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or die \u2014 those are your only options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll never know what to expect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Killer Rabbit is cunning \u2014 he\u2019ll always find a way to catch you by surprise when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability to keep you coming back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items always spawn in different locations, and events never happen in the same order. It\u2019s the Killer Rabbit who decides your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer to share the scares with your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends can play as the children trying to escape, or become the Killer Rabbit to hunt them down.</p></li></ul>","developers":["William Jacob"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/0ec36e630963fee2fc7b531a53e8b9e7bbc722cf/header.jpg?t=1763555944","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum"